Components I built for the student dashboard

For my Learning Management Platform, I built these interactive components:
Component	            |   Purpose
Navbar / Sidebar        |   Navigation between courses, quizzes, assignments, and progress
CourseCard	            |  Displays course info (title, description, progress)
QuizCard	            |  Shows quiz questions and multiple-choice options; tracks user answers
AssignmentForm	        |  Allows students to upload assignments and submit them via API
ProgressTracker	        |  Shows progress bars for completed courses, quizzes, and assignments
Loading / Spinner Component    |   Displays while data is being fetched from API
Notification / Alert Component |   Shows success or error messages dynamically


